# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Financial Control Tower — environment
#
# EVERY variable here is optional. With an empty .env the application runs in
# full Demo Mode: deterministic synthetic data, deterministic detection and
# scoring, a clearly-labelled local gateway adapter, and no external calls.
# Nothing is stubbed out and no screen is disabled.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Razorpay (test mode only) ---------------------------------------------
# Supply a TEST key pair to switch the gateway badge from "DEMO — SYNTHETIC
# DATA" to "LIVE TEST MODE" and make the executor issue real calls against
# Razorpay's test environment (POST /v1/orders, GET /v1/orders/:id/payments).
#
# The client refuses any key that does not begin with rzp_test_. There is no
# code path that accepts a live-mode credential.
RAZORPAY_KEY_ID=
RAZORPAY_KEY_SECRET=

# --- Language model (optional) ---------------------------------------------
# When set, the model is used for ONE thing: rewriting the investigation
# summary as prose. It never produces a figure that is displayed, and it cannot
# execute, widen or approve an action. Without it, the built-in deterministic
# summary is shown and the badge reads "Deterministic".
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
AI_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5

# --- Database (optional) ---------------------------------------------------
# prisma/schema.prisma documents the relational model the in-memory dataset
# mirrors one-for-one. The demo does not require a database; set this only if
# you are wiring the repository layer to Postgres.
DATABASE_URL=
